#TrafficUpdate

It's still an encouraging vehicular flow from Berger moving towards Secretariat, Tollgate, Alapere down to Iyana Oworo.

Traffic moves gradually from Iyana Oworo connecting the Third mainland bridge upto Adeniji due to high volume of vehucular movements, couplex with a broken down Mazda bus at Unilag Water Front en route Island.
 Recovery is expected to be done soon as a tow truck is already on ground for its removal.

